pos.text:
One of the best idle game probably ever made.

732 hours just to finish the game WITH the help of many spreadsheets.
In total :
6 Google Docs followed;
15 Discord Channels for the entire game;
Many many MANY pins checked and messages checked;
A lot of help in the discord server (genuinely adorable people there);

In the game:
4 Layer of Prestige;
More than 300+ Upgrades, with each Prestige Layer having their own mechanics.
4th layer is probably the best and the most complete in term of content.
A somewhat interesting lore, not pushed like triple A's game but still present, and enough to link everything together and make the game enjoyable as it is.
The game has a lot more stored than you probably think. there is a lot of secrets, inside jokes....

Yes this is a semi-idle game, but it is worth playing and experimenting. I would say the game is obiously not 100% perfect, as many timewalls
